ok - record: every window with its used percent and reset, spendPriority, runway, plan size, and notes from every source, printed in full
ok - record: private (0600) timestamped records with retention of the newest 50
ok - record: a failed store read is recorded as failed, printed, and exits nonzero
ok - gate: refuses on no record, stale record, uncovered account or store, an unmappable provider family, and a record already spent on a launch
ok - gate: an exhausted account is refused naming the window and its reset time
ok - gate: a 0% window is refused naming the window and its reset time
ok - gate: a model-scoped window without percent or reset evidence is refused
ok - gate: an unpublished 5h window passes as not published; a missing 7d window or Notes entry is refused
ok - gate: a passing candidate prints its full window table with used percents and notes
ok - gate: the FM_QUOTA_INTAKE_TEST_BYPASS escape hatch is explicit and loud
ok - cached read: a fresh statusline cache is recorded with its own used percents, marked cached, and gates
ok - cached read: a statusline cache older than 30 minutes fails closed
